    "Downloaded models and runtimes will be removed. Projects, source videos and finished exports are kept.": "已下载的模型和运行时将被删除。项目、源视频和完成的导出将保留。",
    "All app-managed model downloads and partial files will be removed. Projects, source videos, finished exports and runtimes are kept.": "所有应用程序管理的模型下载和部分文件将被删除。项目、源视频、完成的导出和运行时将保留。",
