    "Model centre: repair downloads": "模型中心：修复下载",
    "Repair download checks checksums and downloads only missing or damaged files. Download again fetches fresh copies and verifies them before replacing current model files. Both operations keep your chosen engines and projects. Pause conversion before starting model maintenance.": "修复下载检查校验和，仅下载缺失或损坏的文件。重新下载获取新副本，并在替换当前模型文件前进行验证。两项操作均保留您选择的引擎和项目。开始模型维护前请暂停转换。",
