    "Checks every file and downloads only missing or damaged files. Current model choices and projects are kept.": "检查每个文件，仅下载缺失或损坏的文件。当前模型选择和项目保持不变。",
    "Downloads fresh copies into a staging folder. Existing model files are kept until the new files have passed checksum verification.": "将新副本下载至暂存文件夹。现有模型文件在通过校验和验证前保持不变。",
    "Model files verified": "模型文件已验证",
    "Model repair failed. See Terminal for details.": "模型修复失败。请查看终端以获取详细信息。",
    "Download paused": "下载已暂停",
