    "Default track": "默认音轨",
    "Recording to use": "用于录音",
    "Stop playback": "停止播放",
    "No captions": "无字幕",
    "Full AI review required": "需要完整 AI 审核",
    "Roles and shared voice references require Full AI review. Choose Expert mode → Production defaults → More options → Full AI review before starting a new conversion. Full AI review takes approximately three times as long as Normal mode; actual time varies with hardware, video length and optional visual analysis. Existing results are kept when you change this setting.": "角色和共享语音参考需要完整 AI 审核。在开始新转换前，请选择专家模式 → 生产默认值 → 更多选项 → 完整 AI 审核。完整 AI 审核所需时间约为正常模式的三倍；实际时间因硬件、视频长度和可选视觉分析而异。更改此设置时，现有结果将被保留。",
    "Normal and High speed modes imitate the source voice per line. Existing reference samples do not mean full character analysis has been completed.": "正常和高速度模式逐行模仿源语音。现有参考样本并不意味着已完成完整角色分析。",
    "Create a separate audio track for each selected engine and dubbing language in one conversion. Engines run in sequence to limit memory use. Extra engines need their models installed and increase processing time.": "在一次转换中为每个选定的引擎和配音语言创建单独的音频轨道。引擎按顺序运行以限制内存使用。额外引擎需要安装其模型并会增加处理时间。",
    "Interface mode and production mode": "界面模式和生产模式",
    "Basic and Expert are two views of the same projects. Normal, High speed and Full AI review control how a new conversion is processed. Changing the view does not restart a job or change an already submitted job.": "基础模式和专家模式是同一项目的两种视图。正常、高速度和完整 AI 审核控制新转换的处理方式。更改视图不会重启任务或更改已提交的任务。",
    "Basic mode: automatic conversion": "基础模式：自动转换",
    "Add one or more videos using Add videos in the top workspace header, or drop them into the window. Choose one voice engine, dubbing languages and output subtitles. Keep Japanese audio if wanted, then choose Start conversion. For a paused job, Resume continues with its original settings.": "使用顶部工作区标题栏中的“添加视频”添加一个或多个视频，或将它们拖入窗口。选择一个语音引擎、配音语言和输出字幕。如需保留日语音频，请选择“开始转换”。对于暂停的任务，“继续”将使用其原始设置继续。",
    "Follow, listen and find the output": "跟随、收听并查找输出",
    "Milestones show the current stage and time spent. Follow processing moves the preview to the current line. Turn it off to browse freely. Listen plays the generated recording; Play original plays the Japanese source. After completion, Play output opens the finished movie and Show file reveals its folder. Projects and exports keeps the time record; Back to preview returns to editing.": "里程碑显示当前阶段和耗时。跟随处理会将预览移至当前行。关闭它以自由浏览。收听播放生成的录音；播放原始播放日语源文件。完成后，播放输出打开完成的电影，显示文件揭示其文件夹。项目及输出保留时间记录；返回预览返回编辑。",
    "Expert mode: edit and compare": "专家模式：编辑和比较",
    "Select Edit, then click a dialogue clip in the timeline. Choose HK or EN to edit that dubbing script. Listen compares recordings; Retake lets you choose an engine and generate just that line; Adjust changes timing and trimming. Use recording adopts the engine shown under that button. Save draft keeps your edits; Export video creates a new version. Earlier exports and recordings are retained.": "选择编辑，然后单击时间轴中的对话片段。选择 HK 或 EN 编辑该配音脚本。收听比较录音；重录允许您选择引擎并仅生成该行；调整更改时间和修剪。使用录音采用该按钮下显示的引擎。保存草稿保留您的编辑；导出视频创建新版本。之前的导出和录音将被保留。",
    "Expert mode: multiple voice engines": "专家模式：多个语音引擎",
    "Open Production defaults, or Edit → Production. Expand Additional voice engines and select the engines to include. The main Voice engine supplies the default track. A new conversion generates a separate track for every selected engine and dubbing language, sequentially to limit memory use. Install models for extra engines through Model centre → Add / switch model first. Selecting engines does not add tracks to an already running or resumed job.": "打开生产默认设置，或编辑 → 生产。展开其他语音引擎并选择要包含的引擎。主语音引擎提供默认音轨。新转换会为每个选定的引擎和配音语言生成单独的音轨，按顺序处理以限制内存使用。通过模型中心 → 添加/切换模型先为其他引擎安装模型。选择引擎不会向正在运行或恢复的任务添加音轨。",
    "Recommended for everyday conversion. Imitates the Japanese source voice per line, checks missing speech, names and language locally, and preserves Japanese OP / ED. It does not run full character or visual analysis.": "适用于日常转换。逐行模仿日语源语音，检查缺失的语音、名称和语言，并保留日语 OP/ED。不执行完整的角色或视觉分析。",
    "Pause, resume and remove": "暂停、恢复和移除",
    "Pause & save before quitting during conversion. Resume keeps the submitted settings; new choices apply to new conversions. Remove opens a confirmation before clearing that project’s processing files. Original videos, completed exports and downloaded models are kept.": "转换期间暂停并保存后再退出。恢复会保留已提交的设置；新选择适用于新转换。移除会在清除该项目处理文件前弹出确认对话框。原始视频、已完成导出和下载的模型将保留。",
