    "Hong Kong Cantonese culture": "香港粤语文化",
    "A hobby project by SCKC, created for the joy of reimagining anime through everyday Hong Kong Cantonese. AniCanto brings a familiar, expressive local voice to favourite stories and shares Cantonese culture with anime fans around the world. Translations may be imperfect; unexpected moments are part of the fun. English dubbing, original Japanese audio and switchable Cantonese and English subtitles make it easy to listen, explore and compare.": "这是 SCKC 的一个爱好项目，旨在通过日常香港粤语重新想象动漫。AniCanto 为喜爱的故事带来熟悉且富有表现力的本地声音，并与全球动漫爱好者分享粤语文化。翻译可能不完美；意外时刻也是乐趣的一部分。英语配音、原始日语音频以及可切换的粤语和英语字幕，让您轻松聆听、探索与对比。",
    "1. Prepare your studio": "1. 准备您的工作室",
    "Review the download plan, then install missing models. Existing healthy files are reused.": "审查下载计划，然后安装缺失的模型。现有的健康文件将被复用。",
    "2. Bring an episode": "2. 导入剧集",
    "Add one or more videos. Choose a voice engine, dubbing languages and subtitles.": "添加一个或多个视频。选择语音引擎、配音语言和字幕。",
    "3. Start and listen": "3. 开始并聆听",
    "Start conversion. Follow the milestones and audition completed lines while other work continues.": "开始转换。在后台处理其他任务的同时，跟踪进度里程碑并试听完成的台词。",
    "4. Find your finished video": "4. 查找已完成的视频",
    "Play output or Show file opens the exported movie. Processing time remains in the project record.": "播放输出或显示文件可打开导出的影片。处理时间仍保留在项目记录中。",
    "Expert editing": "专家级编辑",
    "Select a timeline line to edit, audition or retake it. Save your draft and export a new version. Switching modes keeps the same project and settings.": "选择时间轴上的行进行编辑、试听或重录。保存草稿并导出新版本。切换模式将保留相同的项目和设置。",
    "No server connection. Restart the app or repair the local runtime.": "无服务器连接。请重启应用程序或修复本地运行时环境。",
    "Preparing video preview…": "正在准备视频预览…",
    "This video could not be previewed. Conversion data is retained.": "无法预览此视频。转换数据已保留。",
    "Model setup runs in the background. You can enter the studio and return here.": "模型设置将在后台运行。您可以进入工作室并稍后返回此处。",
    "Automatic subtitles + Japanese audio": "自动字幕 + 日语音频",
    "Japanese audio + screen OCR": "日语音频 + 屏幕 OCR",
    "Listen to Japanese first, detect lower-screen subtitles automatically, then combine the evidence for translation. No manual crop is required.": "先听取日语，自动检测屏幕下方的字幕，然后结合证据进行翻译。无需手动裁剪。",
    "Uses external or embedded text subtitles when available. Otherwise detects lower-screen OCR automatically. Japanese audio remains the primary source.": "在可用时使用外部或内嵌文本字幕。否则自动检测屏幕下方的 OCR。日语音频仍为主要来源。",
    "Subtitles are detected automatically. Without text tracks, lower-screen OCR is used alongside Japanese speech.": "自动检测字幕。若无文本轨道，则结合屏幕下方的 OCR 与日语语音。",
    "Model download sources & checksums": "模型下载源及校验和",
    "Most models come from Hugging Face. Some Windows translation models come from Ollama; supporting code may come from GitHub. Each model keeps its own licence.": "大多数模型来自 Hugging Face。部分 Windows 翻译模型来自 Ollama；支持代码可能来自 GitHub。每个模型保留其自己的许可。",
    "These are expected SHA-256 checksums from this app version. They do not mean your installed files were just checked. Use Repair / download again in Model centre to verify installed files.": "这些是此应用程序版本的预期 SHA-256 校验和。它们并不意味着您已安装的文件刚刚被检查。请在模型中心使用“修复”/“重新下载”来验证已安装的文件。",
    "Search models, sources or filenames": "搜索模型、来源或文件名",
