Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Source timing review": "原声分段复核", "Suspicious source fragments were checked locally. Confirm unresolved source speech before regenerating; OCR never supplies the speech clock.": "已局部复听可疑原声碎段；未确认位置请先比较原声，OCR 不决定发声时间。", "Subtitle allocation review": "字幕内容配对复核", "Some screen captions span several spoken turns. Compare the original speech and per-line caption candidates; candidate matches are not a quality pass.": "部分画面字幕跨越多段原声；请比较原声与每句字幕候选，候选配对不代表质量通过。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Reset state": "重设状态", "Return this video to a newly added state. The next conversion uses current production defaults; previous outputs and recordings remain on disk.": "将影片恢复为新加入状态；下次使用当前制作默认设置重新开始，保留旧成品及录音文件。", "Clear this video’s saved progress, draft, references, subtitle choices and recording links from the queue item.": "清除此影片列表项目的保存进度、草稿、参考、字幕选择及录音链接。", "The source video, previous exports, recordings and installed models are kept. Production defaults and other videos are unchanged. No conversion starts automatically.": "保留源影片、旧成品、录音及已安装模型。制作默认设置及其他影片不变，不会自动开始转换。", "Pause processing before resetting a video.": "请先暂停处理，再重设影片状态。", "The video state changed. Review the reset again.": "影片状态已变化，请重新确认重设。", "Video state reset. Ready with current production defaults.": "已重设影片状态，下次使用当前制作默认设置。", "Adding videos…": "正在加入影片…", "Loading video…": "正在载入影片…"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Confirm reset state": "确认重设状态", "Confirm reset": "确认重设", "Preparing reset confirmation…": "正在准备重设确认…", "Resetting video state…": "正在重设影片状态…", "Review reset again": "重新确认重设", "This video is no longer in the list. Open the menu again.": "此影片已不在列表，请重新打开菜单。", "The reset target changed. Open the menu again.": "重设目标已变化，请重新打开菜单。", "The reset confirmation expired. Review the reset again.": "重设确认已失效，请重新确认。", "Unable to confirm reset. Review the current state before retrying.": "无法确认重设结果，请先检查当前状态再重试。", "Video state was reset, but the view could not refresh. Select the video again.": "影片状态已重设，但界面无法刷新；请重新选择此影片。", "Confirm or cancel the reset menu before starting a conversion.": "请先确认重设或关闭菜单，再开始转换。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Speech recognition only": "仅用语音识别", "Compare OCR with speech": "OCR 与语音合并比较", "Content source for conversion": "转换内容来源", "Conversion subtitle source": "转换使用的字幕来源", "Use for conversion": "用于转换", "Conversion subtitle source saved.": "已保存转换字幕来源。", "The player subtitle selector changes playback only.": "播放器的字幕选择只影响播放。", "Selected subtitles provide the dialogue meaning. Audio recognition provides speech timing. Without subtitles, use speech recognition. OCR compares both sources and is opt-in.": "已选字幕决定对白含义，语音识别提供发声时间；无字幕才用语音稿。OCR 需另行选择并合并比较。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Source subtitle read — dubbing not generated": "已读入原字幕；此段未生成配音", "Subtitle split needs review": "字幕分段需要复核", "Subtitle allocation could not be confirmed. The original audio is retained. Restart translation with the updated workflow; a voice-only update keeps the old empty script.": "未能确认字幕对应的原声片段，已保留原音。请用更新流程重新翻译；仅更新配音会保留旧空白稿。", "The full subtitle was retained once at its main speech interval. Check the timing and speaker before accepting.": "完整字幕已保留在主要原声时段，请先核对时间和说话人。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Content priority workflow": "内容优先流程", "Use preference defaults": "使用偏好设置默认值", "Speech > subtitles": "语音 > 字幕", "Subtitles > speech": "字幕 > 语音", "Speech > OCR": "语音 > OCR", "OCR > speech": "OCR > 语音", "Default content priority": "默认内容优先流程", "When text subtitles are available": "有内置／外挂文字字幕", "Without text subtitles": "无可用文字字幕", "The first source determines meaning; the second assists. OCR paths apply only without usable embedded or external text subtitles. Speech timing always follows the original audio.": "前者决定内容含义，后者辅助。OCR 路径仅在没有可用内置／外挂文字字幕时使用；发声时间始终跟随原音。", "Basic mode uses these defaults automatically. Expert mode can override the workflow for new conversions. Saved jobs keep their frozen settings.": "一般模式自动使用这两个默认值；专家模式可为新转换选择其他流程。已保存任务沿用冻结设置。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Content priority follows the selected workflow. Basic mode uses preference defaults; Expert mode can choose a workflow. OCR is used only without usable text subtitles. Speech timing always follows the original audio.": "内容优先权遵循所选流程：一般模式使用偏好设置默认值，专家模式可另选。OCR 仅在无可用文字字幕时使用；发声时间始终跟随原音。"});

