Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Work mode": "工作模式", "Performance": "性能", "Quality": "质量", "One draft and basic audio recovery; skip voice listening and timing rewrites.": "一轮初稿及基本补声；跳过配音回听和缩稿重配。", "Listen to generated voices and apply bounded local repairs; frame analysis is optional.": "回听配音，有限度修复个别问题；画面分析单独选择。", "Keep audible first takes; repair missing audio and measured overruns, then finish with fallback.": "保留首轮有声录音；只补缺声及实测超时，必要时用后备完成输出。", "Full AI review (including frame analysis)": "完整 AI 复核（包括画面分析）", "Off by default. Adds deeper source and visual character analysis and can take much longer.": "默认关闭。额外分析原声及角色画面，可能大幅增加处理时间。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Use an installed system voice if AI fallback fails": "AI 备用失败时使用已安装系统声线", "Uses only voices already installed for the target language; no downloads. Voice character may differ. Turn off to use original audio as the final fallback.": "只使用已安装且符合目标语言的声线，不会下载；音色可能不同。关闭后以原音作为最后备用。", "Confirmed defects trigger bounded fallback. Uncertain recordings remain labelled for listening.": "确认错误内容才有限补救，未确认录音保留提示供试听。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"One first take; no content listening or shortening. Recovery allowance: 60 seconds.": "首录一次，不回听内容或缩稿；全片修复预算 60 秒。", "Keep usable first takes; bounded listening and fallback. Recovery allowance: 180 seconds.": "保留可用首录，有限回听及备用；全片修复预算 180 秒。", "Up to three initial attempts; bounded listening and timing repair. Recovery allowance: 600 seconds.": "首次最多三次，有限回听及对时修复；全片修复预算 600 秒。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"Automatic processing": "自动处理", "Full AI review": "完整 AI 复核", "Detect openings and endings": "检测片头／片尾", "Translate dialogue in OP / ED": "翻译 OP／ED 中的对白", "Try another installed voice model": "尝试其他已安装配音模型", "Installed system voice fallback": "已安装系统声线备用", "Voice fallback options": "配音备用设置", "Full AI review adds slow frame analysis. System fallback uses installed target-language voices; the voice may differ.": "完整 AI 复核会额外分析画面，较慢。系统备用只用已安装目标语声线，音色可能不同。", "These settings apply to new work. Paused conversions keep their saved settings.": "设置用于尚未开始的任务；已暂停转换沿用原先保存的设置。"});

Object.assign(LOCALE.ui,{"One first take kept; only fully silent takes retry, at most twice, with no alternate or system voice substitution. Repair time adapts to measured work, capped at 5 minutes.": "首录一次并保留；只有完全无声才补录，最多两次，不改用后备或系统声线；按实测工作量分配补声时间，上限 5 分钟。", "Keep fitting first takes. One measured timing rewrite; repair first, then optional suspect listening. Repair cap: 15 minutes; listening: 1 minute.": "保留合时首录；实测过长可缩稿重配一次。先补声，再局部回听；修复上限 15 分钟，回听另限 1 分钟。", "Up to three initial attempts and two measured timing repairs. Repair first, then broader listening. Repair cap: 30 minutes; listening: 3 minutes.": "首次最多三次，实测对时最多两次。先补声，再较全面回听；修复上限 30 分钟，回听另限 3 分钟。"});
